   "en": "⟦0⟧ is a minor country in Northern Europe with a population of ⟦1⟧. It borders ⟦2⟧ to the west and north, ⟦3⟧ to the east and is very close to ⟦4⟧ to the southwest, with the Baltic Sea to the east. While being a minor power, it by far exceeds the other Scandinavian countries in strength, due to its better manpower and resources. Though rich in useful resources, it remains sharply constrained by its relatively small population and its pursuit of neutrality, leaving it mostly free to watch the coming storm.",
